  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "If you receive a VRC gift from a friend while you have an annual Meta subscription, the start date and expiration date of the gift will overlap with your Meta subscription.\n\nThere’s also a bug where the web interface displays “This Month Gifted By” as your Meta subscription.\n\nMaybe it’ll become VRC++?\n\nIf so, that would be really cool.\n\nThis bug report might be the reason behind it.\n\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/if-you-purchase-an-annual-plan-via-meta-it-will-be-labeled-as-a-monthly-plan",
